      "message": "It\u0027s for providing AVF\u0027s network feature rapidly towards ferrochrome.\n\nOriginally the workflow should be:\n1. Creating a TAP interface per VM.\n2. Creating a bridge interface shared by all VMs, and make a connection with TAP interfaces.\n3. Enable tethering with bridge interface.\n\nBut, we\u0027ve switched the workflow to reduce hacky things in Ferrochrome ASAP:\n1. Creating a TAP interface per VM.\n2. Enable tethering with TAP interface in advance for interim solution. (In this phase, we can supply internet connection to ferrochrome, it\u0027ll resolve your curiosity why I left TODO.)\n3. Creating a bridge interface shared by all VMs, and make a connection with TAP interfaces.\n4. Enable tethering with bridge interface, replaced from TAP interface.",
